ful work, familiar places, and the people who notice what others pass by.\"}\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </motion.div>\n          </section>\n          <section className=\"art:mx-auto art:w-full art:max-w-6xl art:px-4 art:@min-[640px]/artemis:px-8\">\n            <motion.article {...reveal}>\n              <a href=\"#rounded-article\" className=\"art:group art:block art:rounded-3xl art:border art:border-border/60 art:bg-background art:p-2 art:focus-visible:outline-none art:focus-visible:ring-2 art:focus-visible:ring-ring\">\n                <div className=\"art:aspect-[16/10] art:overflow-hidden art:rounded-2xl art:@min-[640px]/artemis:aspect-[3/1]\">\n                  <motion.img whileHover={reduce ? undefined : { scale: 1.025 }} transition={{ duration: 0.45, ease: ARTEMIS_EASE_OUT }} src=\"/assets/artemis/16585090b4f1acf6efb9.avif\" alt=\"A quiet cafe interior lit by tall windows\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1350\" className=\"art:h-full art:w-full art:object-cover\"/>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"art:grid art:gap-8 art:p-5 art:@min-[640px]/artemis:p-8 art:@min-[768px]/artemis:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] art:@min-[768px]/artemis:items-end\">\n                  <div className=\"art:max-w-2xl\">\n                    <p className=\"art:font-medium art:text-muted-foreground art:text-xs art:uppercase art:tracking-[0.14em]\">\n                      {\"Featured / \"}\n                      {\"Places\"}\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 className=\"art:mt-5 art:text-balance art:leading-tight art:tracking-[-0.045em] art:text-4xl art:font-medium\">\n                      {\"The room before opening\"}\n                    </h2>\n                    <p className=\"art:mt-4 art:max-w-md art:text-pretty art:text-muted-foreground art:leading-7\">\n                      {\"A cafe has a different rhythm before the first order. We spent a morning with the people who prepare that quiet hour.\"}\n           